<title>POLAND: Polish NBP buys dollars at PLN 3.2192 - dealers.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP buys dollars at PLN 3.2192 - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) again bought dollars on the interbank market, this time at 3.2192 zlotys, dealers said.</p>
<p>The intervention, described as &quot;medium&quot;, came at 1150 GMT when the zloty was at 1.53 percent from the dollar/mark parity rate for today -- the centre of the daily 14-percent trading band.</p>
<p>Earlier the NBP also bought dollars at 3.2195 zlotys and zlotys at 1.8799 and 1.8800 zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
